<ans># Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co Ltd — Q1 FY26 Financial Data Extraction

## Summary of Findings

A direct review of the Aditya Birla Capital / Aditya Birla Health Insurance financials disclosure page (`adityabirlacapital.com/healthinsurance/about-us/financials`) and its associated "Download Centre" was conducted, along with targeted searches for the IRDAI quarterly "NL" public-disclosure return set for the period ended **30 June 2025**.

**Key finding:** The company's official financials/disclosure page does **not** currently host a Q1FY26 "NL" statutory return set (NL-1 Revenue Account, NL-2 expense schedule, or Balance Sheet) for the quarter ended 30-Jun-2025. The only NL-series filing discoverable on the site is a legacy archived filing for the quarter ended **31-Dec-2016**, which falls outside the scope of this request and was therefore not used to backfill any figures. The financials/downloads landing pages returned no current-quarter statutory PDFs at the time of this research.

As a result, the **statutory IGAAP-only line items** — Net Written Premium, Net Earned Premium, standalone PAT, claims/expense/commission ratio breakouts, Expense of Management ratio, Solvency ratio, Net worth, AUM, and Investment yield — are **not published** in any locatable source for this period and are left blank in accordance with the instruction not to estimate or substitute a zero value.

The only figures that could be sourced are the **headline segment metrics** disclosed in the **Aditya Birla Capital Q1 FY26 Investor Presentation** (dated 4-Aug-2025), which reports the Health Insurance business on an IND-AS consolidated segment basis rather than as a standalone statutory filing.

