ainability)\n- [Press and Media](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/press-and-media)\n\n![abc_finance_logo_nav](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/-/media/ABCCorp/data/media/img/newlogo.webp?extension=webp)\n\nAditya Birla Capital Limited (\u201cABCL\u201d) is a listed systemically important non-deposit taking Non-Banking Financial Company (NBFC) and the holding company of the financial services businesses. ABCL and its subsidiaries/JVs provides a comprehensive suite of financial solutions across Loans, Investments, Insurance, and Payments to serve the diverse needs of customers across their lifecycles. Powered by over 68,400 employees, the businesses of ABCL have a nationwide reach with over 1,740 branches and more than 200,000 agents/channel partners along with several bank partners.\n\n\n![](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/assets/images/abfl_nav1.png)\n\nNationwide Branches\n\n1,740\n\n![](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/assets/images/abfl_nav2.png)\n\nNo. of Employees\n\n68,400\n\n![](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/assets/images/abfl_nav3.png)\n\nAgents/Channel Partners\n\n2,00,000+\n\n![](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/assets/images/abfl_nav4.png)\n\nAggregate Assets\n\nINR 5.91 Lakh Cr\n\n![](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/assets/images/abfl_nav6.png)\n\nConsolidated Lending Book\n\nINR 2.00 Lakh Cr\n\n- ABCL![arrow](https://abconeprod.azureedge.net/dist/ABCCorp/assets/images/navRedi-arrow.svg)\n- [Policy for appointment of Statutory\\\\\nAuditors](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/loans/-/media/ABCL/pdf/Aditya-Birla-Finance-Limited/02-BCLPolicy-on-Appointment-of-Statutory-auditor-20Reviewed.webp?extension=webp)\n- [ABCL NRC Policy](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/loans/-/media/ABCL/pdf/Aditya-Birla-Finance-Limited/ABFL-NRC-Policy.ashx)\n- [Corporate Social Responsibility](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/loans/corporate-social-responsibility)\n- [Fair Practices Code](https://www.adityabirlacapital.com/loans/fair-practices-code)\n- [Int